1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,720
 Consider moralizing invitation.

2
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:08,840
 Yay, come unto Christ and be perfected in Him.

3
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:12,200
 Deny yourselves of all ungodliness.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:15,480
 Three key truths to note.

5
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:19,520
 One, come, it's an action.

6
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:24,840
 We choose to move from our current place to a better place.

7
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:28,040
 Two, deny yourselves.

8
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:29,480
 Surrender.

9
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:34,280
 Let go of the things that are holding us back.

10
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:37,760
 Three, be perfected in him.

11
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,760
 Come as we are with the willing heart.

12
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:43,720
 He will give us a new heart.

13
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:48,040
 We do not need to perfect ourselves to come to Christ.

14
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:51,800
 We come to Christ to be perfected.

15
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:56,400
 President Russell M. Nelson taught, perfection is pending.

16
00:00:56,400 --> 00:01:00,560
 It can come in full only after the resurrection

17
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:03,480
 and only through the Lord.

18
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:07,840
 It awaits all who love him and keep his commandments.

19
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:12,040
 Last June, on the way to the airport,

20
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,040
 President Bragg,

